 Varzi took over the lead after doing a sub 1m38s lap.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":1},{"lap":3,"text":"Already on the third lap Varzi started to pull away lowering the lap time with another second.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":1},{"lap":5,"text":"On the fifth lap Farina found a way past Brivio to take third position and soon left his team mate far behind.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":2},{"lap":10,"text":"Varzi leads Nuvolari by 12 seconds after ten laps.","q":false,"c":1},{"lap":15,"text":"Nuvolari speeds up; the two trade tenths of a second lap after lap.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":20,"text":"After 20 laps, with one third of the race done, the distance between them still remained about 12 seconds.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi"},{"lap":25,"text":"He did the 25th lap in 1m35.3s lowering the gap to 10 seconds.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":26,"text":"The gap comes down by another two seconds.","q":false},{"lap":28,"text":"After 28 laps the gap was down to 5.6 seconds.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi"},{"lap":30,"text":"Varzi gained back 0.8 seconds on lap 29 only to lose it again on lap 30.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi"},{"lap":31,"text":"Nuvolari catches Varzi.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":33,"text":"Nuvolari and Varzi race close together.","q":false},{"lap":34,"text":"Then on the 34th lap Nuvolari passed the Auto Union, setting in a new fastest lap with a time of 1m34.5s.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":35,"text":"Nuvolari successfully defended his position during lap 35 and pulled away a bit on the next lap","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":37,"text":"Varzi closes the gap again.","q":false,"c":1},{"lap":39,"text":"Nuvolari and Varzi run nose to tail.","q":false},{"lap":40,"text":"Lapping third-placed Farina, Nuvolari is let by, while Varzi is held up; Nuvolari laps in 1m34s.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":43,"text":"The time was equaled by Varzi on lap 43.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":1},{"lap":45,"text":"After 45 laps the gap had grown to 7 seconds","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi"},{"lap":57,"text":"Varzi laps in 1m33.4s.","q":false,"c":1},{"lap":60,"text":"Nuvolari wins, 8.8 seconds ahead of Varzi; Farina, Brivio and Tadini follow, well behind.","q":false,"c":0}]}